# Books flow after an edit

When you finish editing, run:

```bash
node scripts/books-flow-check.mjs --run
```

The script reads the files changed in git. Docs, mobile, quotes, reports, and reconciliation edits print `books-flow: skip` and do not open a browser. A signup, onboarding, invoice, payment, expense, or GST edit runs `tests/e2e/accountant-books.spec.ts` on Chromium. Fix a failure before you finish.

Do not start that Playwright test yourself for an unrelated edit. The script is the decision. Pass file paths only when you need to check a list that is not the git diff.
